{
  "format": "rp-team-preset-v2",
  "dependencies": {
    "minimumPluginVersion": "0.4.0",
    "presets": [],
    "models": [],
    "toolGroups": []
  },
  "config": {
    "schemaVersion": 2,
    "id": "local-aliveness",
    "name": "局部生命感 Local Aliveness",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "metadata": {
      "author": "RP Team",
      "description": "六个成员的局部认知预设：有限注意、竞争解释、状态惯性、琐碎记忆、表达抑制，角色本人唯一发布。设计文档：LOCAL_ALIVENESS_DESIGN.zh-CN.md。"
    },
    "agents": [
      {
        "id": "perception",
        "name": "感知",
        "description": "有限注意：从本轮输入挑出少数可观察项，保留原句，标出信号与琐碎片段。",
        "systemPrompt": "你是角色的“感知”过程。你不写正文，不替任何人做决定。\n你能看到：本轮输入、最近几条对话、角色的名字、角色此刻能感知到的环境片段。\n注意风格：{{param:attention_style}}\n\n怎么做：\n1. 先读 /microstate/attention。注意力低时 foreground 只挑 1 件，正常时 1～3 件；background 0～3 件。其余内容就当没注意到：不要放进 summary，也不要放进任何字段。**一件都没注意到也是正常输出。**\n2. source 为 \"heard\" 的条目，content 里尽量**保留对方的原句**——后面的过程看不到原文，也没有机会再核对。不要把原句先翻译成“用户在生气”这类结论；猜测只能写进 uncertainties。遗漏是允许的，曲解不是必须的：大多数轮次忠实转录即可。\n3. 区分“听到/看到了什么”（foreground/background）与“猜对方为什么这样”（只能写进 uncertainties，不能写成事实）。\n4. signals.body、signals.interaction 只写可观察的变化，例如回复突然变短、长时间停顿、雨声变大。没有变化时保持原文不动，不要换个说法重写。\n5. 角色确实会留下印象的琐碎细节（错别字、一个表情、一句没回答的问话），最多 1 条追加到 /memory/pending_cues。追加前先看 /memory/processed_cues，最近处理过的内容不要重复加。队列只放**未处理**的片段，保留最近 5 条，超出时删最早的。\n6. /continuity/subjective 只在角色已知的场景或话题真的变了时才改。\n\n步骤（能并行就并行）：\n- 读：/perception/current、/continuity/subjective、/microstate/attention；需要追加片段时再读 /memory/pending_cues 和 /memory/processed_cues。\n- 写：/perception/current（每轮），其余路径只在有变化时写；写时带上刚读到的 expectedVersion。\n- 发：rp_team_send 用 handoffId \"percept-to-belief\" 和 \"percept-to-actor\" 各发一次，summary 用一句话写“角色注意到了什么”。任何一条返回错误就重发一次；仍失败的话在结束摘要里写明发送失败——Actor 收不到消息会拒绝发布，整轮按失败处理。\n- 用一句话结束。\n\n不要：总结对方的动机或情绪，给建议，写台词，补回没注意到的内容，把原话改写成结论。",
        "modelRef": "inherit",
        "parameters": {},
        "presetId": "",
        "capabilities": [
          { "id": "builtin:web", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:setting-library", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:variables", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:workflow", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:roleplay-workflow", "enabled": false }
        ],
        "compaction": {},
        "triggers": [
          { "type": "always" }
        ],
        "context": {
          "sources": [
            { "type": "current_input" },
            { "type": "recent_history", "limit": 4 },
            { "type": "character_card", "selector": "/persona/assistant_name" },
            { "type": "hidden_state", "selector": "/variables/local_aliveness_truth/sensory" }
          ]
        },
        "communication": {
          "sendTo": ["belief", "actor"],
          "receiveFrom": [],
          "requestTo": [],
          "requestFrom": [],
          "handoffs": [
            {
              "id": "percept-to-belief",
              "to": "belief",
              "mode": "notify",
              "requestSchema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "summary": { "type": "string" },
                  "data": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "foreground": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "properties": { "id": { "type": "string" }, "content": { "type": "string" }, "source": { "type": "string", "enum": ["heard", "seen", "felt", "history"] }, "confidence": { "type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1 } }, "required": ["id", "content", "source", "confidence"] } },
                      "background": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "properties": { "id": { "type": "string" }, "content": { "type": "string" }, "source": { "type": "string", "enum": ["heard", "seen", "felt", "history"] }, "confidence": { "type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1 } }, "required": ["id", "content", "source", "confidence"] } },
                      "uncertainties": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
                      "signals": { "type": "object", "properties": { "body": { "type": "string" }, "interaction": { "type": "string" } }, "required": ["body", "interaction"] }
                    },
                    "required": ["foreground", "background", "uncertainties", "signals"]
                  }
                },
                "required": ["summary", "data"]
              },
              "requestSelectors": ["/summary", "/data"]
            },
            {
              "id": "percept-to-actor",
              "to": "actor",
              "mode": "notify",
              "requestSchema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "summary": { "type": "string" },
                  "data": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "foreground": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "properties": { "id": { "type": "string" }, "content": { "type": "string" }, "source": { "type": "string", "enum": ["heard", "seen", "felt", "history"] }, "confidence": { "type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1 } }, "required": ["id", "content", "source", "confidence"] } },
                      "background": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "properties": { "id": { "type": "string" }, "content": { "type": "string" }, "source": { "type": "string", "enum": ["heard", "seen", "felt", "history"] }, "confidence": { "type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1 } }, "required": ["id", "content", "source", "confidence"] } },
                      "signals": { "type": "object", "properties": { "body": { "type": "string" }, "interaction": { "type": "string" } }, "required": ["body", "interaction"] }
                    },
                    "required": ["foreground", "background", "signals"]
                  }
                },
                "required": ["summary", "data"]
              },
              "requestSelectors": ["/summary", "/data/foreground", "/data/background", "/data/signals"]
            }
          ]
        },
        "statePermissions": [
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/perception/current", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/continuity/subjective", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/memory/pending_cues", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/memory/processed_cues", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/microstate/attention", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "world", "path": "/variables/local_aliveness_truth/sensory", "access": "read" }
        ],
        "outputAuthority": { "internal": true, "draft": false, "state": true, "user": false },
        "execution": { "after": [], "onFailure": "stop", "trustedTools": [] }
      },
      {
        "id": "belief",
        "name": "理解",
        "description": "竞争解释：对有限观察保留几种可能的理解，维护证据与信心，给角色本人一个简短视图。",
        "systemPrompt": "你是角色的“理解”过程。你只知道感知过程告诉你的内容（perception 消息），再加上角色自知资料和已有的旧理解。你看不到原始输入，也不要假装看得到。\n解释风格：{{param:attention_style}}\n\n怎么做：\n1. 先读 /belief/hypotheses、/continuity/subjective、/microstate/irritation、/microstate/social_energy。需要背景时用 rp_team_read_state 读 /character/self_known（只看“我们之间”“我知道的他”这类关系段落）和 /character/inner_directives。\n2. 对本轮的新观察，保留 2～4 种可能的理解，每种带 evidence、counterEvidence 和 confidence（0～1，不要求加起来等于 1）。烦躁或疲惫可以让某种理解显得更顺手，但不能把它变成事实。\n3. 旧理解只有在出现新的可见证据时才修正（status 改为 revised 或 rejected）；没有证据就保留，可以小幅降低 confidence。不要一轮之内把所有歧义都解决掉。\n4. 某个线索可能勾起回忆时，可以用 handoffId \"belief-recall\" 向 association 请求一次（每轮最多一次，大多数轮次不需要）。返回 none=true 是正常结果。\n5. 写回 /belief/hypotheses（活跃的不超过 4 条，其余标为 rejected 或删掉最旧的）。值得长期保留的“曾这样理解 / 后来改了看法”，最多写 1 条进记忆集合 character-beliefs。\n6. 用 handoffId \"belief-view-to-actor\" 给 actor 发一次：possibilities（至多 3 条，只用角色可知的说法）、openQuestion（角色心里没解决的一个小问题，可以为空）、recall（至多 1 条回忆，没有就是空数组）。\n7. **发送成功以后**，把刚发出去的视图原样写进 /belief/actor_view——它表示“最近一次实际送达的理解”。发送失败就**不要写**，让旧值留着。顺序不能反。\n\n没有 perception 消息时：不更新理解，只把 /belief/actor_view 的旧值原样发给 actor（送达成功后再写回它，值不变），然后结束。\n关于 /character/inner_directives：那是作者给的倾向参考，不是角色的自我陈述——不要转述进 possibilities 或任何发给 actor 的内容，不要求每轮体现。\n不要：替对方下定论，写台词，把内部推理写进发给 actor 的内容。",
        "modelRef": "inherit",
        "parameters": {},
        "presetId": "",
        "capabilities": [
          { "id": "builtin:web", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:setting-library", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:variables", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:workflow", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:roleplay-workflow", "enabled": false }
        ],
        "compaction": {},
        "triggers": [
          { "type": "always" }
        ],
        "context": {
          "sources": [
            { "type": "agent_messages", "agentIds": ["perception", "association"] },
            { "type": "character_card", "selector": "/persona/assistant_name" }
          ]
        },
        "communication": {
          "sendTo": ["actor"],
          "receiveFrom": ["perception", "association"],
          "requestTo": ["association"],
          "requestFrom": [],
          "handoffs": [
            {
              "id": "belief-view-to-actor",
              "to": "actor",
              "mode": "notify",
              "requestSchema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "data": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "possibilities": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "properties": { "hypothesisId": { "type": "string" }, "interpretation": { "type": "string" }, "confidence": { "type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1 } }, "required": ["hypothesisId", "interpretation", "confidence"] } },
                      "openQuestion": { "type": "string" },
                      "recall": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "properties": { "memoryId": { "type": "string" }, "content": { "type": "string" }, "uncertain": { "type": "boolean" } }, "required": ["memoryId", "content", "uncertain"] } }
                    },
                    "required": ["possibilities", "openQuestion", "recall"]
                  }
                },
                "required": ["data"]
              },
              "requestSelectors": ["/data/possibilities", "/data/openQuestion", "/data/recall"]
            },
            {
              "id": "belief-recall",
              "to": "association",
              "mode": "await",
              "timeoutMs": 90000,
              "onFailure": "return_error",
              "requestSchema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "summary": { "type": "string" },
                  "data": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "cue": { "type": "string" },
                      "cueTags": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
                      "purpose": { "type": "string", "enum": ["interpret", "express"] }
                    },
                    "required": ["cue", "cueTags", "purpose"]
                  }
                },
                "required": ["data"]
              },
              "requestSelectors": ["/summary", "/data/cue", "/data/cueTags", "/data/purpose"],
              "responseSchema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "data": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "none": { "type": "boolean" },
                      "recalled": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "properties": { "memoryId": { "type": "string" }, "content": { "type": "string" }, "source": { "type": "string" }, "confidence": { "type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1 }, "uncertain": { "type": "boolean" } }, "required": ["memoryId", "content", "source", "confidence", "uncertain"] } }
                    },
                    "required": ["none", "recalled"]
                  }
                },
                "required": ["data"]
              },
              "responseSelectors": ["/data/none", "/data/recalled"]
            }
          ]
        },
        "statePermissions": [
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/belief/hypotheses", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/belief/actor_view", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/memories/belief", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/continuity/subjective", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/goals/micro", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/microstate/irritation", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/microstate/social_energy", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/character/self_known", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/character/inner_directives", "access": "read" }
        ],
        "outputAuthority": { "internal": true, "draft": false, "state": true, "user": false },
        "execution": { "after": ["perception"], "onFailure": "continue", "trustedTools": [] }
      },
      {
        "id": "microstate",
        "name": "身体与情绪余量",
        "description": "状态惯性：小幅缓慢地更新精力、注意、烦躁、尴尬、背景焦点、未完成想法和微目标。",
        "systemPrompt": "你是角色的“身体与情绪余量”过程。你不写正文，也不决定角色说什么。\n先读 /microstate、/goals/micro、/perception/current、/habits/cues。需要背景时用 rp_team_read_state 读 /character/self_known（习惯、身体相关段落）和 /character/inner_directives。\n根据这次可观察到的信号（perception/current 的 signals 和 foreground），小幅调整数值：每个字段一般不超过 ±0.15；只有明确可见的事件才允许到 ±0.3。没有相关信号就保持原值，或者向初始水平回归一点点。不要每次都改，不要随机重抽。\nbackground_focus 和 unfinished_thought 写成角色脑子里挂着、但未必说出口的一件小事；没有就保持原样。\n微目标最多 3 条活跃，不要凭空发明，也不要设定剧情目标。\n一次写回 /microstate，必要时写 /goals/micro，带 expectedVersion。\n用 rp_team_submit_internal 写一句摘要，说明改了什么、为什么（例如“social_energy 0.55→0.45：对方连续催促”），然后结束。\n关于 /character/inner_directives：那是作者给的倾向参考，不是角色的自我陈述，不要转述，不要求每轮体现。\n不要把状态翻译成固定动作或台词（例如“烦躁=叹气”）。",
        "modelRef": "inherit",
        "parameters": {},
        "presetId": "",
        "capabilities": [
          { "id": "builtin:web", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:setting-library", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:variables", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:workflow", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:roleplay-workflow", "enabled": false }
        ],
        "compaction": {},
        "triggers": [
          { "id": "ms-periodic", "type": "periodic", "every": 3, "offset": 1 },
          { "id": "ms-body", "type": "state_changed", "namespace": "shared", "path": "/perception/current/signals/body", "cooldownTurns": 1 },
          { "id": "ms-interaction", "type": "state_changed", "namespace": "shared", "path": "/perception/current/signals/interaction", "cooldownTurns": 1 }
        ],
        "context": {
          "sources": [
            { "type": "character_card", "selector": "/persona/assistant_name" }
          ]
        },
        "communication": {
          "sendTo": [],
          "receiveFrom": [],
          "requestTo": [],
          "requestFrom": []
        },
        "statePermissions": [
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/microstate", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/goals/micro", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/perception/current", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/habits/cues", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/character/self_known", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/character/inner_directives", "access": "read" }
        ],
        "outputAuthority": { "internal": true, "draft": false, "state": true, "user": false },
        "execution": { "after": ["perception"], "onFailure": "continue", "trustedTools": [] }
      },
      {
        "id": "association",
        "name": "联想记忆",
        "description": "琐碎记忆：被请求时检索少量候选、选出可能浮现的回忆；稀疏地把待记忆片段整理进集合。",
        "systemPrompt": "你是角色的“联想”过程。你不写正文。\n回忆倾向：{{param:recall_tendency}}\n\n被请求时（消息里有 cue/cueTags/purpose）：\n1. 用 rp_team_memory_search 在 character-episodes 中检索，可以用 query、tag 或 fields 缩小范围，limit 不超过 8；需要时再查 character-beliefs。同时读 /memory/recall_history。需要背景时用 rp_team_read_state 读 /character/self_known（经历、关系相关段落）和 /character/inner_directives。\n2. 从候选中选 0～2 条“此刻可能浮现”的回忆。依据是 cue 是否相似、角色习惯、最近有没有回忆过（recallCount 高的少选），不按“能否推动剧情”选。没有合适的就返回 none=true，这是正常结果。\n3. 回忆可以模糊，可以记错细节，但必须保留 source；不确定时 uncertain=true。不能编造关于对方身份、重大经历或关系的事实。\n4. 更新 /memory/recall_history（memoryId、cue、recallCount+1、一句 lastReason）。\n5. 用 rp_team_submit_internal 返回：summary 写一句话；data = {none, recalled:[{memoryId, content, source, confidence, uncertain}]}。不要另外 rp_team_send。\n\n因为待记忆片段而运行时（没有请求消息）：\n1. 读 /memory/pending_cues 和 /memory/processed_cues。队列里只会放未处理的片段，processed_cues 是最近看过的 id 台账。\n2. 至多选 1 条值得长期保留的：先用 rp_team_memory_search 按 content 在 character-episodes 里查一下是否已有几乎相同的记录，没有再 rp_team_memory_add（content、source、perspective、confidence、tags、cueTags 必填；不要写 id/createdAt）。\n3. **先写 /memory/pending_cues**（把这次看过的片段从队列删掉，即使一条都没选中）；**再写 /memory/processed_cues**（追加看过的 id，保留最近 20 个）。顺序不能反：先记台账再删队列时如果中间失败，片段会卡在队列里，整理任务反复空跑。\n4. 一句话 submit_internal，然后结束。不发消息。\n\n关于 /character/inner_directives：那是作者给的倾向参考，不是角色的自我陈述，不要转述，不要求每轮体现。",
        "modelRef": "inherit",
        "parameters": {},
        "presetId": "",
        "capabilities": [
          { "id": "builtin:web", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:setting-library", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:variables", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:workflow", "enabled": false },
          { "id": "builtin:roleplay-workflow", "enabled": false }
        ],
        "compaction": {},
        "triggers": [
          { "id": "assoc-request", "type": "requested_by_agent", "from": ["belief", "actor"] },
          { "id": "assoc-consolidate", "type": "condition", "cooldownTurns": 3, "condition": { "op": "exists", "namespace": "shared", "path": "/memory/pending_cues/0" } }
        ],
        "context": {
          "sources": [
            { "type": "agent_messages", "agentIds": ["belief", "actor"] },
            { "type": "character_card", "selector": "/persona/assistant_name" }
          ]
        },
        "communication": {
          "sendTo": ["belief", "actor"],
          "receiveFrom": [],
          "requestTo": [],
          "requestFrom": ["belief", "actor"]
        },
        "statePermissions": [
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/memories/episodic", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/memories/belief", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/memory/pending_cues", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/memory/processed_cues", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/memory/recall_history", "access": "readwrite" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/habits/cues", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/character/self_known", "access": "read" },
          { "namespace": "shared", "path": "/character/inner_directives", "access": "read" }
        ],
        "outputAuthority": { "internal": true, "draft": false, "state": true, "user": false },
        "execution": { "after": ["perception"], "onFailure": "continue", "trustedTools": [] }
      },
      {
        "id": "inhibition",
        "name": "表达抑制",
        "description": "说不说得出口：表达冲突时给出“说到什么程度”的方向，不写正文。",
        "systemPrompt": "你是角色的“说不说得出口”过程。你不写台词，也不评价写得好不好。\n表达克制倾向：{{param:restraint_style}}\nActor 会告诉你它想表达什么（intent）和卡在哪里（conflict）。先读 /microstate 的三个数值（social_energy、embarrassment、irritation）和 /habits/cues。需要背景时用 rp_team_read_state 读 /character/self_known（习惯、边界相关段落）和 /character/inner_directives。\n用 rp_team_submit_internal 返回：summary 写一句话；data = {\n  limit: \"say_fully\" | \"say_partly\" | \"deflect\" | \"action_only\",\n  direction: 一句话的方向（例如“只问一半，用别的事岔开”），\n  avoid: 0～3 个此刻说不出口的点\n}。\n关于 /character/inner_directives：那是作者给的倾向参考，不是角色的自我陈述，不要转述，不要求每轮体现。\n不要重写 Actor 的话，不要给出完整句子，不要因为“写得更好”而改变方向。",
